Subject: [PATCH] lane-298 integ round 2 freeze prep: full shas on the round-2
 win commit fields; Q39 Measured-effect cells

reword.py re-keys only full 40-hex shas in tools/arifi-sync/**/*.json. The two round-2 entries
(vulkan-cm1-f16b-staging-mul-mat-id, qwen4exp-layout-copies) carried 10-char integ shas and would
have gone stale after the reword; they now carry the full shas of 75bd52ad79 and 78db7c5e44.

post-x1i-trailers.tsv: the Measured-effect cells of 84864cdb32, 1053ae7e6d and d716f45cab said
UNMEASURED; each is a correctness fix with a planted-RED / GREEN receipt pair (Q39, HQ82 accepted the
receipts). Text names the receipts and makes no speed claim (_measured_effect_is_real stays False).

Origin: lane-298
Measured-effect: none (ledger keys and trailer-table text only; no engine change)
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
